  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n3 tan245° + 2 cos 60° − 2 sin 30°\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\ntan 45º = 1\n\ncos 60° = (1)/(2)\n\nsin 30° = (1)/(2)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 3 tan² 45° + 2 cos 60° – 2 sin 30° \n\n⇒ 3 × 1² + 2 × (1)/(2) – 2 × (1)/(2)\n\n⇒ 3 × 12 + 2 × (1)/(2) – 2 × (1)/(2) = 3 × 1 + 1 – 1\n\n⇒ 3 × 1 + 1 – 1 = 3\n\n**∴ The required value of the given expression is 3**",
